{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"Сунан Абу Дауд","section":{"21":"Funerals (Kitab Al-Jana'iz)"},"section_detail":{"21":{"hadithnumber_first":3089,"hadithnumber_last":3241,"arabicnumber_first":3089,"arabicnumber_last":3241,"name_native":"Книга похорон (Джаназа)"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3139,"arabicnumber":3139,"text":"А в версии аль-Лейса говорится, что во время погребения погибших в битве при Ухуде в одну одежду заворачивали по два тела","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":21,"hadith":51}}]}